@startuml state-bug-lifecycle
title Bug lifecycle (FR-06, backend/app/services/lifecycle.py)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

[*] --> Open : submitted (severity predicted\nor Unclassified)

Open --> InProgress : PM or assignee;\nautomatic when a PM assigns
InProgress --> Resolved : assignee\n(resolution recorded)
Resolved --> Verified : reporter of the bug\nor project Reporter (QA)
Resolved --> InProgress : reporter / QA:\nverification failed (reopened)
Verified --> Closed : PM (close_reason = fixed)
Open --> Closed : PM: invalid or duplicate\n(duplicate_of_id set)
Closed --> [*]

note right of Open
  Any other change -> 409 Conflict.
  A valid change by the wrong role -> 403.
  Administrators may act as assignee/verifier.
  Archived projects are read-only.
  Every change is written to audit_log and
  notifies reporter and assignee.
end note
@enduml
